# PhotoPrism API reference

When implementing or debugging PhotoPrism integration, use the **official Swagger API docs** as the source of truth:

- **https://docs.photoprism.dev/** — interactive Swagger UI for all `/api/v1` endpoints, request/response schemas, and parameters.

Use this instead of guessing from blog posts or older docs. For auth details, the developer guide (e.g. docs.photoprism.app) can supplement the Swagger reference.
